msgid "参与开发"
msgstr "Contributing"

msgid "职责与修改"
msgstr "Responsibilities and changes"

msgid ""
"先阅读根 AGENT.md、真实源码、构建图和工作树。保留已有用户修改， 避免未授权提交、推送、分支和进程操作。自研源码登记到所属 Kbuild， 不恢复平行编译链。内核工作在 ReliefNT "
"子仓完成，主仓只记录其 gitlink。 文档修改也必须核对实际接口、命令、路径和失败边界。"
msgstr ""
"First read the root AGENT.md, actual sources, build graph, and working tree. Preserve existing "
"user changes and avoid unauthorized commits, pushes, branches, or process operations. Register in-"
"house sources in their owning Kbuild; do not restore parallel build pipelines. Kernel work belongs"
" in the ReliefNT subrepository; this repository records only its gitlink. Documentation changes "
"must also check actual interfaces, commands, paths, and failure boundaries."

msgid "代码与接口"
msgstr "Code and interfaces"

msgid ""
"函数注释说明职责、参数所有权、可空性、容量、锁与执行上下文，返回值 包含错误及特殊状态。保留项目已有 Doxygen 约定；采用 RST 手册不要求批量改写 代码注释。私有实现不作为公共 "
"UAPI，跨层变化同步实现、头导出和真实消费者。 不要以增加 sleep、吞错误或关闭验证替代根因修复。"
msgstr ""
"Function comments describe responsibilities, parameter ownership, nullability, capacity, locks, "
"and execution context; return-value documentation includes errors and special states. Preserve "
"existing Doxygen conventions; adopting an RST manual does not require mass rewriting code "
"comments. Private implementations are not public UAPI. Cross-layer changes must synchronize "
"implementations, header exports, and real consumers. Do not replace root-cause fixes with sleeps, "
"swallowed errors, or disabled validation."

msgid "安全与问题报告"
msgstr "Security and issue reports"

msgid ""
"TLS、认证和存储错误保留阶段、返回码与设备/构建身份，不记录密码、令牌、 Cookie、私钥或请求体。问题报告注明版本/提交、平台、命令、配置和复现步骤。 "
"安全报告区分静态观察与实际运行证据，不虚构修复版本或验证结果。"
msgstr ""
"TLS, authentication, and storage errors retain stage, return code, and device/build identity, "
"without logging passwords, tokens, cookies, private keys, or request bodies. Issue reports include"
" version/commit, platform, command, configuration, and reproduction steps. Security reports "
"distinguish static observations from runtime evidence and never invent fixed versions or "
"validation results."
